[{:db/id "1adbe12d-f32a-5283-bfd1-ceea4ff485dd" :answer/id #uuid "1adbe12d-f32a-5283-bfd1-ceea4ff485dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{\\operatorname{ln}6}-5+8e" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ed93bfe6-3d23-5d4d-86fd-f655f3e1d84f" :answer-field/id #uuid "ed93bfe6-3d23-5d4d-86fd-f655f3e1d84f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["1adbe12d-f32a-5283-bfd1-ceea4ff485dd"] :answer-field/correct "1adbe12d-f32a-5283-bfd1-ceea4ff485dd" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "7f163702-82c3-5ed2-8962-43ef81d57fe6" :question/id #uuid "7f163702-82c3-5ed2-8962-43ef81d57fe6" :question/problem "Given the function  $y=3{log}_{6}⁡x-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+8{e}^{x},$ find the instantaneous rate of change at $x=1.$ Do not round the answer.\n\nThe instantaneous rate of change at $x=1$ is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "To differentiate a logarithm with base $a,$ we use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{a}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡a}.\n$$\n\nTo find the instantaneous rate of change at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{log}_{6}⁡x-5\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+8{e}^{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡6}-\\frac{5}{x}+8{e}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the instantaneous rate of change at $x=1$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=1} & ={(\\frac{3}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡6}-\\frac{5}{x}+8{e}^{x})\\,|}_{x=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{1\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡6}-\\frac{5}{1}+8{e}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡6}-5+8e\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["ed93bfe6-3d23-5d4d-86fd-f655f3e1d84f"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "dacc1cb1-f678-5e21-9b7f-a0bb91c67018" :answer/id #uuid "dacc1cb1-f678-5e21-9b7f-